<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank 1-week rev repo yield 16.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank 1-week rev repo yield 16.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield in a Czech National Bank (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender draining liquidity reached the limit yield of 16.0 percent, the CNB said on Monday.</p>
<p>The CNB said it accepted all bids at that level. The overnight Prague interbank offered rate ranged around 16.05 percent in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
